# Every activity type and marker, data objects, the id: and lane: attributes,
# and a start event that begins a second chain in the same pool.
# covers: §4.2, §4.4, §4.5, §5, §9
title "Activity types"

pool Office
  lanes Clerk, Manager
  lane Clerk
  start Request received
  data Request form [collection]
  user Fill in form [writes: Request form]
  script Validate fields [reads: Request form]
  manual File paper copy [sequential]
  rule Decide approval level [id: decide]
  task Countersign [lane: Manager]
  call Standard archiving
  service Notify requester
  end Done
  start timer Month end
  lane Manager
  user Review filed requests [loop]
  end Reviewed
